        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Canelo Álvarez, Amir Khan\n- Event: Canelo Álvarez vs. Amir Khan\n- Titles: WBC middleweight title, Ring magazine middleweight title, lineal middleweight title\n- Places: T-Mobile Arena, Las Vegas Strip, Paradise, Nevada\n\nFacts:\n- Canelo Álvarez vs. Amir Khan, billed as \"Power vs. Speed\" and also known as \"Canelo vs. Khan\" or \"Khanelo,\" took place on May 7, 2016.\n- The Event was a professional boxing fight between Canelo Álvarez and Amir Khan.\n- The Event was contested for the WBC, Ring magazine, and lineal middleweight titles.\n- T-Mobile Arena is a multi-use indoor arena on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada.\n- The Event was the first major boxing sporting event held at T-Mobile Arena.",
